      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::His body twitches.:: 

I've only heard about 'em from others. Ya see, uhm, they are the fiends of your worst dreams. They be creepin' the walls in darkness like spiders or somethin' and they said once you see em' ya ain't gettin' away, ::As he speaks, his pronunciation shifts back and forth.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
